 your favourite way to lose!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/aae9da31f394f8537195e1b067ec2b81.avif?t=1753944429\" width=616 height=154 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/20f641baaf1e275f411897ecb8a9eca1.poster.avif?t=1753944429\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/20f641baaf1e275f411897ecb8a9eca1.webm?t=1753944429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/20f641baaf1e275f411897ecb8a9eca1.mp4?t=1753944429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the choice between multiple powers, and grow stronger with each attempt! Featuring 4 skill trees, unlockable difficulties, abilities, attacks and achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/9a66cca31305a6efb32788e53d6146a4.avif?t=1753944429\" width=616 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/a54267a3d7bebd38226c6df937ac55e1.poster.avif?t=1753944429\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/a54267a3d7bebd38226c6df937ac55e1.webm?t=1753944429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/a54267a3d7bebd38226c6df937ac55e1.mp4?t=1753944429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover New Attacks, Combos, Evolutions and more! All Hand drawn and animated!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/8f66cfeb3d5dca0b88c477a7779db88e.avif?t=1753944429\" width=616 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are only stalling for time. It will <strong>never</strong> be enough.</p>",
