</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover New Attacks, Combos, Evolutions and more! All Hand drawn and animated!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/8f66cfeb3d5dca0b88c477a7779db88e.avif?t=1753944429\" width=616 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are only stalling for time. It will <strong>never</strong> be enough.</p>",
